  status              String   @default("scheduled") // P10: QUEUED | CLAIMED | RUNNING | RETRY_SCHEDULED | COMPLETED | FAILED | SKIPPED | CANCELED | PAUSED. Legacy bump rows keep old values until P11 migration.
